    MC "(Yarın onu yakalayabilirim.)"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:67
translate tr ves_firstmeet_61479d0c:

    # "Opening the flap of her tent, I stepped inside to find Ves sitting cross legged on the floor, inspecting her axes before sharpening them with a vicious-looking rock."
    "Çadırının kanadını açarak, içeri adım attım ve Ves'i bağdaş kurmuş yerde otururken buldum, baltalarını inceliyor ve vahşi görünümlü bir kayayla biliyordu."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:68
translate tr ves_firstmeet_80992f0b:

    # "Looking around the tent which flapped with each gust of wind, I observed that she had done a remarkable job to have survived as long as she had out here in these harsh lands."
    "Her rüzgar esintisiyle çırpınan çadırın etrafına bakınırken, bu sert topraklarda bu kadar uzun süre hayatta kalmasının kayda değer bir iş olduğunu gözlemledim."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:69
translate tr ves_firstmeet_2c9aacee:

    # "Sprawled across the floor were a mixture of fur rugs made from the hides of animals from her many hunts and cloth she had found and hung decoratively."
    "Yere yayılmış, birçok avından hayvan derilerinden yapılmış kürk kilimler ile bulup dekoratif olarak astığı kumaşların bir karışımıydı."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:70
translate tr ves_firstmeet_80cc8164:

    # "Here and there were various pieces of equipment and intricate looking items she had fashioned out here in this small corner of the desert."
    "Şurada burada çeşitli ekipman parçaları ve çölün bu küçük köşesinde burada yaptığı karmaşık görünümlü eşyalar vardı."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:71
translate tr ves_firstmeet_63e642cd:

    # "There was a small wooden tub, presumably for washing in but I couldn’t even begin to guess where she managed to find enough water to get close to filling it in these barren lands."
    "Küçük bir ahşap küvet vardı, muhtemelen yıkanmak için ama bu çorak topraklarda onu doldurmaya yetecek kadar suyu nereden bulduğunu tahmin etmeye bile başlayamadım."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:72
translate tr ves_firstmeet_03f711ff:

    # "Her bed was comprised of a cluster of blue quilts and pillows that seemed almost out of place in the desert, had she stolen them?"
    "Yatağı, çölde neredeyse yersiz görünen bir mavi yorgan ve yastık kümesinden oluşuyordu, onları mı çalmıştı?"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:73
translate tr ves_firstmeet_f29e70bc:

    # "The bedframe itself was notably made with some craftsmanship, further raising my suspicions on the matter, but I decided not to pry too much into her affairs."
    "Yatak çerçevesinin kendisi belirgin şekilde biraz işçilikle yapılmıştı, bu konudaki şüphelerimi daha da artırdı, ama işlerine çok fazla burnumu sokmamaya karar verdim."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:74
translate tr ves_firstmeet_6e5075fc:

    # "Here and there were jars filled with either water or small dead animals in some preservative substance, scorpions, beetles and such..."
    "Şurada burada içinde su ya da koruyucu bir maddede küçük ölü hayvanlar, akrepler, böcekler ve benzerleri olan kavanozlar vardı..."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:75
translate tr ves_firstmeet_df6a8060:

    # "Presumably kept as small rations of food for when the dried-out meat on the lines outside was running low."
    "Muhtemelen dışarıdaki iplerde kurutulmuş et azaldığında küçük yiyecek erzakı olarak saklanıyordu."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:76
translate tr ves_firstmeet_f16dfa89:

    # "As she tested the sharpness of her axe with her thumb, she looked up coolly at me."
    "Baltasının keskinliğini başparmağıyla test ederken, bana soğukkanlılıkla baktı."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:77
translate tr ves_firstmeet_2252db6b:

    # VES @ talk "What do you want, human?"
    VES @ talk "Ne istiyorsun, insan?"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:85
translate tr ves_dial_talk_5d6f3c6e:

    # VES @ talk "What is it, human?"
    VES @ talk "Nedir, insan?"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:90
translate tr ves_dial_beenout_c1cc84bf:

    # VES @ talk "Not yet, but I will be soon."
    VES @ talk "Henüz değil, ama yakında olacağım."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:91
translate tr ves_dial_beenout_f48a09c0:

    # VES @ talk "Can’t risk supplies getting too low."
    VES @ talk "Erzakın çok azalmasını riske atamam."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:95
translate tr ves_dial_seenanything_b917f69f:

    # VES @ talk "Just your usual small parties of Demorai moving through the sands."
    VES @ talk "Sadece her zamanki gibi kumlarda hareket eden küçük Demorai grupların."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:96
translate tr ves_dial_seenanything_565c2af8:

    # VES @ talk "Oh, and some Skorn... Not much else."
    VES @ talk "Ah, ve biraz Skorn... Pek fazla bir şey yok."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:97
translate tr ves_dial_seenanything_396272dc:

    # VES @ talk "Though I did find a strange temple out here once..."
    VES @ talk "Gerçi bir keresinde burada garip bir tapınak buldum..."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:98
translate tr ves_dial_seenanything_1bd97503:

    # "I raised an eyebrow"
    "Bir kaşımı kaldırdım"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:99
translate tr ves_dial_seenanything_84664fbb:

    # MC @ talk "A temple?"
    MC @ talk "Bir tapınak mı?"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:100
translate tr ves_dial_seenanything_bf3b9ac7:

    # VES @ talk "Just some ruinous thing... Southeast of here."
    VES @ talk "Sadece yıkık dökük bir şey... Buranın güneydoğusunda."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:101
translate tr ves_dial_seenanything_43697f58:

    # MC @ talk "Hm, I see..."
    MC @ talk "Hm, anlıyorum..."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:105
translate tr ves_dial_bye_be8114ea:

    # VES @ talk "Very well."
    VES @ talk "Pekala."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:106
translate tr ves_dial_bye_f300e1c6:

    # VES @ talk "As you are, human."
    VES @ talk "Sen nasılsan, insan."

